---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: "Gallery | The Café"
description: "Photos of the food at The Café in Leavenworth, KS: burgers, wraps, sandwiches, salads, breakfast and daily specials, plus our catering and the cafe itself."
ogDescription: "Food from The Café's kitchen in Leavenworth, KS, plus catering spreads and the cafe."
pageCss: "/assets/css/gallery.css"
---
{#- ===========================================================
    /gallery — food first, because that is what a visitor came to see.

    Every photo comes from data, nothing is typed here:
      On the menu, Daily specials   src/_data/photos.json, newest first,
                                    split by `special`
      Catering, The cafe            src/_data/gallery.json
    Adding a photo is one entry in one of those files, plus `npm run thumbs`
    for its small copy (see the notes in both files).

    Each tile shows the thumbnail (the `thumb` filter, which falls back to
    the full photo) and links to the full photo, so "tap to see it bigger"
    needs no script. The caption is a short visible name; the alt text says
    what is in the picture. No people in any of them: the staff do not want
    photos of themselves online.
    =========================================================== -#}
{%- set menuPhotos = [] %}
{%- set specialPhotos = [] %}
{%- for p in photos.photos | sort(true, false, "date") %}
    {%- if p.special %}{% set _ = specialPhotos.push(p) %}{% else %}{% set _ = menuPhotos.push(p) %}{% endif %}
{%- endfor %}

{%- macro tile(file, alt, caption, position) %}
                <li class="gallery-item">
                    <figure>
                        <a class="gallery-link" href="{{ file }}">
                            <img src="{{ file | thumb }}" alt="{{ alt }}" loading="lazy" decoding="async"{% if position %} style="object-position: {{ position }};"{% endif %}>
                        </a>
                        <figcaption class="gallery-caption">{{ caption }}</figcaption>
                    </figure>
                </li>
{%- endmacro %}

<section class="section" aria-labelledby="gallery-heading">
    <div class="container">
        <h1 id="gallery-heading">Gallery</h1>
        <p class="gallery-lede">Food from our kitchen, a few catering spreads, and the cafe. Tap a photo to see it bigger.</p>

        {%- if menuPhotos.length %}
        <section class="gallery-section" aria-labelledby="gallery-menu">
            <h2 id="gallery-menu">On the menu</h2>
            <ul class="gallery-grid" role="list">
                {%- for p in menuPhotos %}{{ tile(p.file, p.alt, p.title) }}{% endfor %}
            </ul>
            <p class="gallery-note"><a href="/menu">See the whole menu</a></p>
        </section>
        {%- endif %}

        {%- if specialPhotos.length %}
        <section class="gallery-section" aria-labelledby="gallery-specials">
            <h2 id="gallery-specials">Daily specials</h2>
            <p class="gallery-note">A different lunch special every weekday. This week&rsquo;s are on <a href="/menu">the menu page</a>.</p>
            <ul class="gallery-grid" role="list">
                {%- for p in specialPhotos %}{{ tile(p.file, p.alt, p.title) }}{% endfor %}
            </ul>
        </section>
        {%- endif %}

        {%- if gallery.catering.length %}
        <section class="gallery-section" aria-labelledby="gallery-catering">
            <h2 id="gallery-catering">Catering</h2>
            <p class="gallery-note">Lunch for a group, ready for pickup. <a href="/catering">Request catering</a>.</p>
            <ul class="gallery-grid gallery-grid--wide" role="list">
                {%- for g in gallery.catering %}{{ tile(g.file, g.alt, g.caption, g.position) }}{% endfor %}
            </ul>
        </section>
        {%- endif %}

        {%- if gallery.cafe.length %}
        <section class="gallery-section" aria-labelledby="gallery-cafe">
            <h2 id="gallery-cafe">The cafe</h2>
            <ul class="gallery-grid gallery-grid--wide" role="list">
                {%- for g in gallery.cafe %}{{ tile(g.file, g.alt, g.caption, g.position) }}{% endfor %}
            </ul>
        </section>
        {%- endif %}
    </div>
</section>
